  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 3205.01 Investigation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3205.01 Investigation. An individual authorized by the director shall contact the applicant, at his/her place of business, to determine if the applicant meets the requirements of Saf-C 3206.01 through Saf-C 3206.04.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes at Chapter Heading Saf-C 3200) #8915, eff 6-22-07; ss by #9184, eff 6-20-08; ss by #11016, eff 1-6-16",
